  "title": "Every morning",
  "goal": "Say what you usually do with the aorist: okurum, yaparım, çalışırım.",
  "points": ["gp-aorist-forms"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "The aorist says what you usually or always do. After a vowel add `-r` (*okur*), after a one-syllable stem `-Ar` (*yapar*, *içer*), after a longer stem `-Ir` (*çalışır*, *öğrenir*). Then come the endings of the present: *okurum*, *yaparsın*.",
    "see": "gp-aorist-forms"
  },
